# Awakening Eden v21.3 clean public pathways

# Working sources live in the repo but must not be served. The illustration
# library zip alone is 30 MB, and bandwidth is the metered Netlify resource on
# this plan, so a single crawler walking these paths is expensive. Keep them
# out of the public site; they stay in git for the team.
